# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# A stencil, the cheap way: a white face whose eyes and grin are transparent,
# stretched 2x by `fit fill` over a moving rainbow — the rainbow shows around
# the face and through its features. Two faces across the diagonal of a
# 64x64 design (`U 64 64`); the boxes scale with the panel.
S - Rainbow Smiley
U 64 64
L pat 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Rainbow
I @pat/rainbow
L sprite 0 0 32 32 normal 100 none fill 1
N Smiley
I @spr/smiley
L sprite 32 32 32 32 normal 100 none fill 1
N Smiley 2
I @spr/smiley
